+This method is based on an open-source WebGL 2.0 based interactive voxel volume renderer using path tracing that runs in modern browsers [S1, unofficial]. It builds upon the principles of direct volume ray casting [19-direct-volume-ray-casting.md] but adapts them for the fragment shader execution model of WebGL, incorporating shading models typically found in path tracers.
 
